#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/fill_layer_generators/screentone.rst:87
msgid "Transformation"
msgstr "Preoblikovanje"

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/fill_layer_generators/screentone.rst:89
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Select how the pattern is arranged geometrically in the image (position, "
"size, rotation, shear). Some patterns benefit from the capability of "
"choosing horizontal and vertical sizes separately. For example, the sin wave "
"lines pattern has a small period by default and by choosing a large "
"horizontal size the period will look also larger."
msgstr ""
"Izberite način, kako je vzorec razporejanje geometrijsko na sliki (položaj, "
"velikost, vrtenje, maže). Nekateri vzorci imajo koristi od možnosti ločenega "
"izbiranja vodoravnih in navpičnih velikosti. Na primer, vzorec greh valovnih "
"linij ima privzeto majhno obdobje in z izbiro velike vodoravne velikosti bo "
"obdobje videti tudi večje."

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/fill_layer_generators/screentone.rst:95
msgid "Size Mode"
msgstr "Način velikosti"

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/fill_layer_generators/screentone.rst:95
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You can choose between a resolution based mode and a pixel based mode to "
"adjust the geometric transformations of the screen. In the resolution mode "
"you set a resolution and change the frequency of the patterns in lines per "
"inch/cm. The pixel mode is the old one in which you set the size of the "
"cells manually. Those two modes are synched so changing the frequency will "
"change the cell size and vice versa."
msgstr ""
"Izbirate lahko med načinom ločljivosti in načinom, ki temelji na piksli, da "
"prilagodite geometrijske transformacije zaslona. V načinu ločljivosti "
"nastavite ločljivost in spremenite pogostost vzorcev v črtah na palček/cm. "
"Način piksel je star, v katerem ročno nastavite velikost celic. Ta dva "
"načina sta sinhronizirana, zato bo spreminjanje frekvence spremenilo "
"velikost celice in viceverso."

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/fill_layer_generators/screentone.rst:100
msgid "Align to Pixel Grid"
msgstr "Poravnaj z mrežo sl. točk"

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/fill_layer_generators/screentone.rst:100
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If the alignment is set on, all the cells (or macrocells if the alignment is "
"every more than 1 cell) will have the same shapes in terms of pixels, "
"producing a more pleasant and regular tiled structure. The downside is that "
"the range of possible transformations is reduced."
msgstr ""
"Če je poravnava nastavljena, bodo imele vse celice (ali makrocele, če je "
"poravnava vsaka več kot 1 celica) enake oblike glede na piksle, kar bo "
"naredilo prijetnejšo in rednejšo strukturo ploščic. Manj je, da je obseg "
"možnih transformacij zmanjšan."

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/fill_layer_generators/screentone.rst:104
msgid ".. image:: images/layers/fill_layer_screentone_transformation.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/layers/fill_layer_screentone_transformation.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/fill_layer_generators/screentone.rst:104
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"From left to right: dot pattern with round shape without rotation, dot "
"pattern with round shape and rotated 45 degrees, line pattern with sine wave "
"shape and a size of 20px horizontally and vertically, line pattern with sine "
"wave shape and a size of 50px horizontally and 20px vertically."
msgstr ""
"Od leve proti desni: vzorec pike z okroglo obliko brez vrtenja, vzorec pike "
"z okroglo obliko in zasukanih 45 stopinj, vzorec črte z obliko sine valov in "
"velikostjo 20px vodoravno in navpično, črtani vzorec z obliko sine valov in "
"velikostjo 50px vodoravno in 20px navpično."

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/fill_layer_generators/screentone.rst:110
